  "description": "QICVUW crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C128 H132 Gd4 N12 O16 S6,C2 H3 N1. From the CIF bond table, Gd4 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd5 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd6 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd1 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd7 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd8 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.594-3.940 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.22-112.70°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C130H135Gd4N13O16S6. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
